[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10442.63, "timestamp": "02:54:02", "text": "溪流？哦，他确实是。这很酷。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10444.469, "timestamp": "02:54:04", "text": "顺便说一句，他状态极佳。在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10446.63, "timestamp": "02:54:06", "text": "设置很高，因为他很有钱，而且他的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10450.15, "timestamp": "02:54:10", "text": "电脑体积真大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10452.469, "timestamp": "02:54:12", "text": "该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10455.429, "timestamp": "02:54:15", "text": "我无法提供代码。如果这个游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10458.309, "timestamp": "02:54:18", "text": "实际上很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10461.429, "timestamp": "02:54:21", "text": "呃，如果这款游戏真的好玩的话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10464.469, "timestamp": "02:54:24", "text": "我应该……多少钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10468.389, "timestamp": "02:54:28", "text": "多少钱？这个多少钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10471.59, "timestamp": "02:54:31", "text": "它就像个魔鬼，你知道吗？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10473.67, "timestamp": "02:54:33", "text": "这不是我们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10477.91, "timestamp": "02:54:37", "text": "是的，对于演示版来说，它确实有点大了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10480.469, "timestamp": "02:54:40", "text": "有趣的。我想我们会加入你们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10483.269, "timestamp": "02:54:43", "text": "今天的世界，因为我的世界已经结束了，你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10485.83, "timestamp": "02:54:45", "text": "知道。哦，我得再做一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10487.83, "timestamp": "02:54:47", "text": "然后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10489.75, "timestamp": "02:54:49", "text": "不，你只需要开始游戏就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10492.55, "timestamp": "02:54:52", "text": "那你得给我发个“是”的回复。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10496.79, "timestamp": "02:54:56", "text": "代码。我去吃饭。回来。所以，"}]